# Keep the build context small and keep host-only artefacts out of the image.
# node_modules especially: the deps stage installs them for the target
# platform, and copying a macOS-resolved tree over that would be silently wrong.
# infra likewise: nothing in the image comes from it, and .terraform under it is
# a few hundred megabytes of provider binaries plus local state.
node_modules
infra
.git
.github
dist
out
coverage
test
*.log
.DS_Store
.env*
README.md
